CreatePost,did:plc:duaatzbzy7qm4ppl2hluilpg,commit,1760491467428999936,2025-10-15 01:24:27.429000+00:00,bafyreid3whsxqtnbjtk5bb43retqzw4pjhsqy5fy7yv4xit7m33mxuv5ny,create,app.bsky.feed.post,en,As outlined in 'Determined' and pretty much his entire oeuvre Sapolsky is looking for a scientific theory for consciousness.  Which is fine as asking questions and hypothesizing answers is how the first part of science goes representation..
86000
CreatePost,did:plc:duaatzbzy7qm4ppl2hluilpg,commit,1760491467430000128,2025-10-15 01:24:27.430000+00:00,bafyreiclyhbg6rdoclgvefc4up7jskdklibdkxixtu4op6jtpgqw3ym6ue,create,app.bsky.feed.post,en,The second part of science intervening is where it is shown that the hypothesized answers allow things to be done in the world.  I used RTD's to measure wing leading edge surface temperatures to show that the wing anti-ice system performed its intended function..
87000
CreatePost,did:plc:duaatzbzy7qm4ppl2hluilpg,commit,1760491467431000064,2025-10-15 01:24:27.431000+00:00,bafyreig5k4y2y2avkdxvqnufn7t4bf34f37zlble2hmqraywolvqht2epy,create,app.bsky.feed.post,en,How do you test that a set of evolutionary conditions coupled with a set of genetic material coupled with a set of life experiences coupled with a set of in the moment influences leads to a specific brain electro-chemical state that makes a homo sapien choose cake or ice cream or creme brulee?.
84000
CreatePost,did:plc:duaatzbzy7qm4ppl2hluilpg,commit,1760491467432000000,2025-10-15 01:24:27.432000+00:00,bafyreiasyj5rzxjrhafhwdoissmbzsnmqmbncxqxwmkch6s7s2zxgtsy5q,create,app.bsky.feed.post,en,Is it not fundamental to philosophy of science that if a theory is untestable or unrepeatable then it is not scientific?  If it is not scientific then it is an article of faith.  Which again is fine as I have faith that I have a soul and free will..
